\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces The bridge generalizes across the statistic set. \textit  {Left:} absolute correlation of each field-level statistic with the group-scale $\Delta f_{\rm  gas}$ across the 57-run 1P suite: $S(\ell )$ $0.92$, $R(\nu )$ $0.92$, $N_{\rm  min}$ $0.90$, $C_{\kappa y}$ $0.87$, $V_1$ $0.83$, $V_2$ $0.82$, and $N_{\rm  pk}$ $0.28$ (shot-noise dominated). \textit  {Right:} the $R(\nu )$-vs.-$f_{\rm  gas}$ scatter underlying the $R(\nu )$ bar above, $r=0.92$.}}{11}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
